From 67add2dd4d1a6e64929a79ceb3c8de6fb5a9eec9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bugcheck <bugcheck@local>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 03:04:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] Door clearance: no trees / street props in front of
 shop doors (re-bake: CellPkg.VERSION 6)

10 of 198 walk-in doorways were blocked (5 baked street props, 5 tree trunks). The
furniture rows now drop anything whose footprint reaches into a 1.6 x 2 m box in
front of any shop / vacant-unit door (door_clear.gd, same door frames as the shops
layer). CellPkg.VERSION 5 -> 6 so every cell package is re-baked from the new rows.
Live build (packages off): 28 props / trees removed, DOORWAYS 198 checked, 0 blocked.
---
 map_dc/coronado/furniture/door_clear.gd      | 40 ++++++++++++++++++++
 map_dc/coronado/furniture/furniture_layer.gd | 25 ++++++++++++
 map_dc/coronado/perf/cell_pkg.gd             |  2 +-
 3 files changed, 66 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
